<h1>Brown Turkey leaf spot</h1>
<p>Wet springs on <strong>Brown Turkey</strong> often show angular lesions before fruit set.</p>
<p>!<a href="content/figroots-blog/media/cercospora-leaf.jpg">Cercospora-like lesions</a></p>
<h2>What we watch</h2>
<ul><li>Lower-canopy leaves first</li></ul>
<ul><li>No spray advice here — identification only</li></ul>]]></content:encoded>
